    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><em>Dragon worship started with the first humanoid begging not to be eaten.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Domain:&nbsp;</strong>Gain a spell from the sorcerer&rsquo;s Draconic bloodline of up to your class level as a bonus spell. You can replace Charisma with Wisdom in the spell description.</p>\n<p><strong>Domain Spells</strong>: Divine Odem, Sense Dragons, Summon Metallic Dragon</p>"
