    "effect": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Effect",
      "value": "<p>Gain a dragon aspect until the end of the battle or scene. Roll 1d6 [[@d6]]:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><em>Claws and Teeth</em>: You can make unarmed attacks at no penalty, with a d8 damage die.</li>\n<li><em>Wings</em>: You can fly to a nearby location as a move action, but you can&rsquo;t stay airborne.</li>\n<li><em>Tail</em>: You can make a melee basic attack as a quick action once per round with a d4 damage die.</li>\n<li><em>Resistance</em>: Choose fire, cold, acid, poison or lightning, and gain resist that element 16+.</li>\n<li><em>Scales</em>: Gain a +2 bonus to AC and PD.</li>\n<li>Choose one of the above.</li>\n</ol>"
    },
